{"id":101,"nameAr":"سُورَةُ القَارِعَةِ","nameBn":"আল-কারিয়া","nameEn":"Al-Qaari'a","meaningBn":"The Calamity","meaningEn":"The Calamity","verses":11,"typeBn":"মাক্কী","typeEn":"Makki","revelationNo":101,"ayahs":[{"id":56046,"number":1,"globalNumber":6158,"textAr":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","textBn":"করাঘাতকারী,","textEn":"The Striking Calamity -","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56047,"number":2,"globalNumber":6159,"textAr":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","textBn":"করাঘাতকারী কি?","textEn":"What is the Striking Calamity?","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56048,"number":3,"globalNumber":6160,"textAr":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","textBn":"করাঘাতকারী সম্পর্কে আপনি কি জানেন ?","textEn":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56049,"number":4,"globalNumber":6161,"textAr":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","textBn":"যেদিন মানুষ হবে বিক্ষিপ্ত পতংগের মত","textEn":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56050,"number":5,"globalNumber":6162,"textAr":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","textBn":"এবং পর্বতমালা হবে ধুনিত রঙ্গীন পশমের মত।","textEn":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56051,"number":6,"globalNumber":6163,"textAr":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","textBn":"অতএব যার পাল্লা ভারী হবে,","textEn":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56052,"number":7,"globalNumber":6164,"textAr":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","textBn":"সে সুখীজীবন যাপন করবে।","textEn":"He will be in a pleasant life.","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56053,"number":8,"globalNumber":6165,"textAr":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","textBn":"আর যার পাল্লা হালকা হবে,","textEn":"But as for one whose scales are light,","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56054,"number":9,"globalNumber":6166,"textAr":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","textBn":"তার ঠিকানা হবে হাবিয়া।","textEn":"His refuge will be an abyss.","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56055,"number":10,"globalNumber":6167,"textAr":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","textBn":"আপনি জানেন তা কি?","textEn":"And what can make you know what that is?","juz":30,"surahId":101},{"id":56056,"number":11,"globalNumber":6168,"textAr":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","textBn":"প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি!","textEn":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","juz":30,"surahId":101}]}